return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Chapisha tovuti hii katika kila lugha unayochagua, kwenye anwani zake za wavuti, ikiwa na vijina vilivyotafsiriwa, metadata, menyu, bidhaa za WooCommerce, hreflang, ramani za tovuti za kila lugha na llms.txt. Tafsiri ukitumia mpango wako wa Zinn Digital® au ukitumia ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa mtoa huduma.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imesohifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuichukua nafasi yake.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna linalolingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila plagi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na kama inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Msaada','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Weka upya kwa chaguo-msingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii inarudisha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii katika hali yake ya awali. Uendelee?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Utambuzi kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Ingiza faili la mipangilio','Import'=>'Ingiza','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizohamishwa hazina nenosiri, tokeni au funguo za API — utahitaji kuingiza hizo tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Mpangilio wote kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerudi kwenye hali yake ya kwanza.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chochagua faili ya mipangilio iliyosafirishwa kutoka kwa programu jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa usafirishaji wa mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo sio usafirishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilisafirishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi nyingine (%s), kwa hivyo kuileta hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Manenosiri na funguo za API haziwahi kujumuishwa kwenye faili la nje, kwa hivyo weka hizo tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeletwa. Nywila na funguo za API haziingizwi kamwe kwenye faili inayouzwa nje, kwa hivyo weka hizo tena.','Translate'=>'Tafsiri','Manual overrides'=>'Ubadilishaji wa mikono','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Ramani za Wavuti na URL','General'=>'Jumla','Who pays for the translation'=>'Nani anayelipia tafsiri','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Ama mpango wako wa Zinn Digital®, au ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa API. Hakuna kiwango cha bure — kuna mtu anayelipia mtoa huduma kwa kila neno.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Mpango wangu wa Zinn Digital®','My own provider key'=>'Ufunguo wangu wa mtoa huduma mwenyewe','Site ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Tovuti','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, kwenye kichupo cha Tafsiri cha tovuti hii.','Site token'=>'Token ya tovuti','Provider'=>'Mtoa Huduma','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Ufunguo wako, unaotozwa kwako na mtoa huduma. Umehifadhiwa kwenye tovuti hii na kutumwa kwao pekee.','Model'=>'Mfano','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Acha wazi kwa ajili ya mtindo wa bei nafuu zaidi unaofanya kazi hiyo vizuri.','This site is written in'=>'Tovuti hii imeandikwa kwa','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Acha wazi ili kutumia lugha ya tovuti kutoka kwa mipangilio ya WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Lugha za kuchapisha','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Kila moja inayo anwani zake za tovuti na ramani yake ya tovuti. Chapisha tu lugha unazotaka ziwekwe kwenye faharasa.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Tafsiri kiotomatiki ninapochapisha au kusasisha','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Kuhariri ukurasa kunaashiria tafsiri zake kuwa zimepitwa na wakati na zinatengenezwa upya nyuma ya pazia. Kuhariri bila kubadilisha maneno yoyote hakugharimu chochote.','What gets translated'=>'Kinachotafsiriwa','Post types'=>'Aina za machapisho','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Tafsiri anwani za wavuti pia','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Wagenzi wa Ufaransa wanapata /fr/a-propos/ badala ya /fr/about/. Anwani isiyotafsiriwa inaendelea kufanya kazi na kuelekeza upya, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichoorodheshwa kinachoharibika.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Tafsiri vichwa vya SEO, maelezo na maandishi mbadala ya picha','Translate categories and tags'=>'Tafsiri kategoria na lebo','Translate navigation menus'=>'Tafsiri menyu za urambazaji','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Tafsiri bidhaa na sifa za WooCommerce','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Maelezo mafupi, madokezo ya ununuzi, lebo za sifa na maelezo ya anuwai. Bei, SKU na thamani za chaguo zilizohifadhiwa haziguswi kamwe.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Ongeza lebo za hreflang','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Inaiambia injini za utafutaji kwamba kurasa hizi ni ukurasa mmoja katika lugha tofauti. Acha hii iwe imewashwa isipokuwa kama programu-jalizi nyingine tayari inafanya hivyo.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Chapisha ramani ya tovuti kwa kila lugha','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Chapisha llms.txt kwa kila lugha','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Ramani ya tovuti iliyo katika maandishi matupu ambayo injini za majibu za AI zinasoma. Mara nyingi haziwezi kuendesha JavaScript na huenda zisiwahi kuchota ramani ya tovuti.','Language switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji lugha','Style'=>'Mtindo','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Rangi, nafasi na pembe ziko kwenye kichupo cha Mtindo. Kiweke pamoja na kizuizi, msimbo mfupi wa [zinn_language_switcher], au menyu.','Show only these languages'=>'Onyesha lugha hizi pekee','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Acha wazi ili kuonyesha kila lugha unayochapisha.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Taja kila lugha katika lugha yake yenyewe','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch badala ya German. Mtu ambaye hawezi kusoma ukurasa wa sasa hawezi kusoma "German" pia.','Show flags'=>'Onyesha bendera','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi: lugha si nchi, na Kiarabu na Kihispania havina bendera moja isiyowatenga wengi wa wazungumzaji wao.','Include the language being read'=>'Jumuisha lugha inayomilikiwa','Include the original language'=>'Jumuisha lugha asili','Add it to this menu'=>'Ongeza kwenye menyu hii','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Menyu tu uliyoitaja hapa. Hakuna kinachoongezwa kwenye menyu nyingine yoyote kwenye tovuti.','Accent'=>'Lugha','Background'=>'Mandhari ya Nyuma','Text'=>'Maandishi','Corner radius'=>'Kipenyo cha kona','Spacing'=>'Nafasi','Text size'=>'Ukubwa wa maandishi','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Usiiongeze kwenye menyu','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Hariri tafsiri yoyote hapa. Tafsiri iliyohaririwa huwekwa kama ulivyoandika na haifutwi kamwe wakati ukurasa unatafsiriwa tena.','Every language'=>'Kila lugha','Search translations'=>'Tafuta tafsiri','Filter'=>'Chuja','Content'=>'Maudhui','Language'=>'Lugha','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Status'=>'Hali','Save'=>'Hifadhi','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa bado. Chapisha lugha na tafsiri itaanza chinichini.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Anwani hizi ziko hewani. Fungua mojawapo ili kuiangalia, na uwasilishe faharasa ya sitemap kwa Google Search Console.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhariri tafsiri kwenye tovuti hii.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Imehaririwa na wewe — imehifadhiwa','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Chanzo kimebadilishwa — kitafanywa upya','Up to date'=>'Imesasishwa','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linalohitaji uangalifu','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inafanya kazi kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatukuweza kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Plugin hii haikusema kwanini. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi na tutaitazama.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Mara ya mwisho kukaguliwa ilikuwa %s iliyopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(inafungua kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hivi ndivyo vitakavyotumwa hasa — hakuna kingine, wala chochote kilichofichwa. Nywila zako, tokeni na funguo za API hazimo ndani yake.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao klipu','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa msaada wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya usaidizi na kukujibu kupitia barua pepe. Ikiwa unapendelea kutoituma, ikili nakala hapo juu na uibandike kwenye tiketi wewe mwenyewe.','Copied'=>'Imesnakiliwa','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tikiti badala yake — hakuna chochote kuhusu mipangilio yako kilicho kibaya.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® una ripoti yako — marejeleo %s — na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — zile za awali ziliwasili.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti hiyo kwa sasa — hilo ni tatizo letu, si lako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Iiga hapo juu na ufungue tikiti, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosting ya Zinn® ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti, vikoa na nafasi za viungo zilizowekwa, huku pesa zikiwa zimewekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapofurahi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kwa maisha yao','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'Ufunguo wa API ukataliwa. Hakikisha kuwa bado ni halali na una idhini ya kutafsiri, kisha uhifadhi tena.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Mtoa huduma alikataa kwa sababu ya malipo au kiwango kilichowekwa. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa. Angalia salio na vikomo kwenye akaunti yako nao.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa tafsiri anapata tatizo upande wake. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa au kutozwa ada, na itajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Ombi la utafsiri limeshindwa na hatukuweza kuelewa kwa nini. Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','Sitemap index'=>'Faharasa ya tovuti','%s sitemap'=>'%s ramani ya tovuti','LLM content map'=>'Ramani ya maudhui ya LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'Ramani ya maudhui ya LLM ya %s','Languages published'=>'Lugha zilizochapishwa','Site language'=>'Lugha ya tovuti','SEO plugin'=>'Programu jalizi ya SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa tafsiri aliyewekwa bado.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wa API kutoka kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua, au unganisha tovuti na akaunti ya Zinn Digital®, na tafsiri itaanza katika duru inayofuata.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'Inatafsiriwa kwa ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa %s.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa na akaunti ya Zinn Digital®, jambo ambalo ni sawa — mtoa huduma wako anakutoza moja kwa moja.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Bado hujaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Ongeza kitambulisho na tokeni ya tovuti hii kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, au ubadilishe hadi ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa mtoa huduma ili uendeshe bila akaunti.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Imeunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa tafsiri anapata tatizo.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'Tafsiri imesitishwa — mtoa huduma wako anahitaji uangalifu.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Tafsiri bado haijasakinishwa.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Kuna kitu kimeenda vibaya upande wetu.','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Fix this on your account'=>'Rekebisha hili kwenye akaunti yako','Style preset'=>'Modi ya mtindo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Mahali pa kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinabatilisha hili.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hii ikiwa imezimwa na mpangilio wa awali utatumika jinsi ulivyo.','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji lugha cha Zinn®','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'Ruhusu wageni wasome ukurasa huu katika lugha nyingine.','Title'=>'Kichwa cha habari','Use the plugin setting'=>'Tumia mpangilio wa programu jalizi','Dropdown'=>'Menyu ya kuteremka','Inline list'=>'Orodha ya mstari mmoja','Pills'=>'Vidonge','Minimal text'=>'Maandishi machache','Flags and names'=>'Bendera na majina','Stacked list'=>'Orodha iliyopangwa safu wima','Choose a language'=>'Chagua lugha','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo wa DeepL API uliouhifadhi, kwa hiyo hakuna cha kutafsiri nacho.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL haitafsiri katika %s. Chagua Google Gemini au OpenAI kwa lugha hii, au unganisha tovuti na Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'DeepL haikuwezi kufikiwa. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa wala hakuna kilichotozwa; kitajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'Kiwango chako cha herufi za DeepL kimekwisha kwa kipindi hiki. Tafsiri itaanza tena kitakapowekwa upya, auakapoongeza kikomo kwenye akaunti yako ya DeepL.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL ilijibu kwa kitu ambacho hatukuweza kukisoma. Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo wa API wa Google Gemini uliohifadhiwa, kwa hiyo hakuna kitu cha kutafsiri nacho.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Google Gemini haikuwezi kufikiwa. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa wala kutozwa; itajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo wa OpenAI API uliowekwa, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kutafsiri nacho.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'OpenAI haikuwezi kufikiwa. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa wala hakuna kilichotozwa; itajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kukusanya. Ongeza Kitambulisho cha Tovuti na tokeni, au badilisha utumie ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa mtoa huduma.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezekani kufikiwa. Hakuna kilichotumwa; itajaribu tena katika mzunguko unaofuata.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Tafsiri imesitishwa kwenye tovuti hii. Angalia kama akaunti imesasishwa kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. Copy it again from the site\'s Translation tab on your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® ilikataa ishara ya tovuti hii. Nakili tena kutoka kwenye kichupo cha Tafsiri cha tovuti kwenye dashibodi yako.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezi kufikiwa. Tovuti yako inaendelea kutoa tafsiri ambazo tayari inazo.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® ilijibu kwa jibu ambalo hatukuweza kulisoma. Tovuti yako inaendelea kutoa tafsiri zake za sasa.']];